# Proposed features recognized from rib_disc.step by sidecar/import_step.py
# (contract v1 -- see sidecar/CONTRACT.md). Review before use:
# recognition proposes, it does not machine.
# imported with --up z- (model z- is machine +Z) -- coordinates are post-rotation

# F9: cylindrical, axis +Z, full revolution, material inside (a standing boss), flat top cap F14, clean base at z=-35.0 (CHECKLIST row 2.4)
# finish the wall with: run Side(tool=..., surface=F9_Boss, stepover=...)  [stepover is the ring spacing up the wall]
# the tool rides outside at R + r_tool (convex flank; finish_cylinder's mirror)
feature F9_Boss CylinderBoss(dia=100.0, extent=35.0, x=0.0, y=0.0, z=-35.0)

# F12: cylindrical, axis +Z, full revolution, material outside (a bore), opens upward; bottom opens through -- a drillable through hole (CHECKLIST row 2.3)
# consume with: run Form(points=[F12_Hole], tool=..., cycle=Simple)  [the bore carries its own extent, measured down from the stock top]
# through hole -- drill past extent=20.0 by the tip's point length for full-diameter breakthrough
# or finish the wall with: run Side(tool=..., surface=F12_Hole, stepover=...)
feature F12_Hole CylinderBore(dia=10.0, extent=20.0, x=-15.0, y=-30.0)

# F14: planar, normal +Z, topmost planar face (CHECKLIST row 1.1)
feature F14_Top Plane(z=0.0)
